{"seq":3,"slug":"quantization","title":"量化：PQ 与 SQ","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/quantization","wordCount":1415,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"量化-pq-与-sq\">量化：PQ 与 SQ</h1><p>一条 1536 维的 <code>float32</code> 向量占 6144 字节，十亿条就是 6 TB——没有任何单机内存装得下。量化（quantization）就是回答「能不能用几十甚至几个字节表示一条向量」的技术。它不改变分区或图导航的逻辑，而是正交地压缩向量本身，因此可以叠加在 <a href=\"ivf-clustering\">IVF</a> 或 <a href=\"hnsw-graphs\">HNSW</a> 之上。理解量化，就理解了十亿级检索能装进内存的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类量化\">核心概念：三类量化</h2><p>量化按压缩粒度分三类，下表先给全局对照，后文逐一展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>典型压缩比</th>\n<th>召回损失</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标量量化 SQ</td>\n<td>每维 float32→int8</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>很小</td>\n<td>通用、低风险首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘积量化 PQ</td>\n<td>切子空间各自码本</td>\n<td>16x–64x</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>十亿级、内存吃紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二值量化 BQ</td>\n<td>每维压到 1–2 bit</td>\n<td>32x</td>\n<td>较大（需精排）</td>\n<td>超大规模、高维居中分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者不是互斥，且几乎都要配一个「精排」环节：先用压缩向量粗筛大量候选，再对少数候选用原始或更高精度向量重算真实距离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标量量化-sq-最稳的入门\">标量量化 SQ：最稳的入门</h2><p>标量量化逐维独立处理。它先统计每一维的取值范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\min_i, \\max_i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再把 <code>float32</code> 线性映射到 8 位整数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>255</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{v_i - \\min_i}{\\max_i - \\min_i} \\cdot 255\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3449em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">255</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>存储立刻降到原来的四分之一，而距离估计误差很小——因为 int8 对大多数嵌入的动态范围已经够用。SQ 是 2026 年大多数库的默认「先开了再说」的压缩，风险低、收益直接，通常无需精排就能保持高召回。它的天花板也在这：4x 压缩对真正的十亿级仍不够。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乘积量化-pq-切子空间\">乘积量化 PQ：切子空间</h2><p>PQ 的精妙在于「分而治之地建码本」。它把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维向量切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 段子向量，每段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 维；对每一段独立用 k-means 训出一个含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常 256）个中心的码本。于是每段子向量可以用「最近的码本中心编号」（1 字节）代替。一条向量就被压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个字节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始向量 d 维] --&gt; B[切成 m 段子向量]&#10;    B --&gt; C[每段查各自码本&lt;br/&gt;找最近中心编号]&#10;    C --&gt; D[拼成 m 字节 PQ 码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[存储: d*4 字节 变 m 字节]&#10;    F[查询向量 q] --&gt; G[预算 q 到各码本中心距离表]&#10;    G --&gt; H[查表累加 估计 q 到每条码距离]&#10;    H --&gt; I[粗筛候选 再精排]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始向量 d 维] --&gt; B[切成 m 段子向量]\n    B --&gt; C[每段查各自码本&lt;br/&gt;找最近中心编号]\n    C --&gt; D[拼成 m 字节 PQ 码]\n    D --&gt; E[存储: d*4 字节 变 m 字节]\n    F[查询向量 q] --&gt; G[预算 q 到各码本中心距离表]\n    G --&gt; H[查表累加 估计 q 到每条码距离]\n    H --&gt; I[粗筛候选 再精排]</pre><p>查询时用「非对称距离计算」：查询向量不量化，预先算出它到每段码本所有中心的距离表，之后估计它到任意一条 PQ 码的距离只需查表累加，极快。PQ 把 1536 维向量压到比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 个字节（24x），这正是 <a href=\"ivf-clustering\">IVF</a> 配 PQ 组成 IVF-PQ、撑起十亿级检索的关键。代价是码本带来的量化误差，需要精排兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二值量化与-2026-的新进展\">二值量化与 2026 的新进展</h2><p>更激进的二值量化把每一维压到 1 比特（如按是否大于该维均值取 0/1），压缩可达 32x，距离用极快的汉明距离近似。它对「高维、分布居中」的嵌入效果最好，对低维或偏斜分布则召回损失明显，因此必须配一个用原始向量的精排阶段。各家把它产品化为 Qdrant 的 Binary Quantization、Milvus 的相关选项等。</p>\n<p>2026 年的一个值得关注的进展是 RaBitQ 这类「带理论误差界的二值/旋转量化」，在 LanceDB 等系统里落地，宣称在同等高压缩比下比传统 BQ 有更好的召回与更快的索引构建。它的思路是先对向量做随机旋转再二值化，让量化误差分布更可控。这类方法说明量化远未定型，是当前向量检索最活跃的研究前沿之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选哪一种-三条取舍线\">选哪一种：三条取舍线</h2><p>把三类量化放在一起，选择其实收敛到三条取舍线，下表给出决断依据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>取舍线</th>\n<th>倾向 SQ</th>\n<th>倾向 PQ / BQ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存压力</td>\n<td>尚可承受</td>\n<td>十亿级、单机装不下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回要求</td>\n<td>高、不能掉</td>\n<td>可接受先掉再靠精排拉回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程成本</td>\n<td>想低风险</td>\n<td>愿意为码本训练与精排投入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验顺序是：从 SQ 起步，因为它几乎零风险、多数库默认开启；只有当 SQ 的 4x 仍不够、内存成为硬约束时，才升级到 PQ（切子空间、压缩比高但要精排）或 BQ（压缩比最高、召回损失最大）。反过来，为了「一步到位」直接上 BQ 而语料分布并不适合，是本末倒置——量化是用召回换内存的交易，只有当内存确实是瓶颈时这笔交易才划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精排-压缩必付的税\">精排：压缩必付的税</h2><p>所有有损量化都共享一个模式：压缩向量只用于「快速粗筛」，真正的排序要靠精排（rerank / refine）。典型流程是用 PQ/BQ 召回 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 候选，再对这几千条用原始 <code>float32</code> 向量重算精确距离，取最终 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。精排把召回拉回接近无损的水平，代价是要保留一份原始向量（可放磁盘）。</p>\n<p>这意味着量化省的主要是「检索时驻留内存的热数据」，而非「全部存储」。这个区分在做内存预算时至关重要，详见 <a href=\"../applications/scaling-performance\">扩展与性能</a>；而压缩比与召回的具体权衡如何量化测量，则要用 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-tuning\">召回评估与调优</a> 的方法跑出曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量化正交地压缩向量本身，可叠加在 <a href=\"ivf-clustering\">IVF</a> 与 <a href=\"hnsw-graphs\">HNSW</a> 上。</li>\n<li>SQ（4x，低风险）→ PQ（16–64x，切子空间码本）→ BQ（32x，需精排）。</li>\n<li>PQ 用非对称查表距离极快，IVF-PQ 是十亿级经典配方。</li>\n<li>2026 前沿如 RaBitQ：先旋转再二值化，带误差界、召回更优。</li>\n<li>有损量化必配精排，省的是热内存而非总存储，预算见 <a href=\"../applications/scaling-performance\">扩展与性能</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量化：PQ 与 SQ","id":"量化-pq-与-sq"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类量化","id":"核心概念-三类量化"},{"level":2,"text":"标量量化 SQ：最稳的入门","id":"标量量化-sq-最稳的入门"},{"level":2,"text":"乘积量化 PQ：切子空间","id":"乘积量化-pq-切子空间"},{"level":2,"text":"二值量化与 2026 的新进展","id":"二值量化与-2026-的新进展"},{"level":2,"text":"选哪一种：三条取舍线","id":"选哪一种-三条取舍线"},{"level":2,"text":"精排：压缩必付的税","id":"精排-压缩必付的税"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"HNSW 图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/hnsw-graphs"},"next":{"title":"向量数据库产品：Milvus、Qdrant、Weaviate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/systems/vector-databases"}}